idden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-[0.07]\" style=\"background-image:radial-gradient(circle at center, white 0%, transparent 70%);background-size:100px 100px\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 text-center max-w-4xl relative z-10 mt-[10px]\"><span class=\"text-secondary font-serif italic text-lg mb-4 block\">Verified Buyers</span><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-heading font-bold mb-6\">What Pakistan is <span class=\"text-secondary italic\">Saying</span></h1><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 mt-6\"><p class=\"text-white/70 text-base\">Real feedback from our valued customers across Pakistan</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 mt-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-5\"><div class=\"bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/60 p-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:bg-white/60 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col h-full rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex justify-end items-start mb-4\"><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-foreground mb-6 flex-grow\">The Rosemary Hair Toner is a game changer! My hair feels so much stronger and my hair fall has visibly reduced. Highly recommended!</blockquote><div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-border/50\"><p class=\"font-bold text-foreground mb-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\">Ayesha K.<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3 h-3 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>, Pakistan</p><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-medium text-primary bg-primary/5 w-fit px-2.5 py-1 mt-1.5 rounded-full\"></p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/60 p-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:bg-white/60 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col h-full rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex justify-end items-start mb-4\"><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-foreground mb-6 flex-grow\">I&#x27;ve been using the Whitening Cream for two weeks now and my skin is literally glowing. It feels so natural and absorbs quickly!</blockquote><div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-border/50\"><p class=\"font-bold text-foreground mb-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\">Sana M.<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3 h-3 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>, Pakistan</p><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-medium text-primary bg-primary/5 w-fit px-2.5 py-1 mt-1.5 rounded-full\"></p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/60 p-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:bg-white/60 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col h-full rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex justify-end items-start mb-4\"><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-foreground mb-6 flex-grow\">The Teeth Whitening Powder works exactly as described. I noticed a difference after just a few uses. Plus, it really helped soothe my gums.</blockquote><div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-border/50\"><p class=\"font-bold text-foreground mb-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\">Fatima R.<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3 h-3 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"